&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__panel"&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__body"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steps 1.2 and 1.3 already generated the telemetry for this validation. When
cloud export is enabled, the agent continuously sends host metrics and sends
the &lt;code&gt;/movie-validator&lt;/code&gt; spans generated in Step 1.3. You do not need to run
&lt;code&gt;loadgen&lt;/code&gt; again. The workshop logs generated in Step 1.4 are validated locally
and are not part of this cloud check.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>1.6 Upload the configuration to Config Builder</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/foundations/2-opentelemetry-collector-workshops/conf2026-obs1184/1-agent/1-6-config-builder/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/foundations/2-opentelemetry-collector-workshops/conf2026-obs1184/1-agent/1-6-config-builder/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Upload &lt;code&gt;agent_config.yaml&lt;/code&gt; to see its components and pipelines before you
